<Window x:Class="DeskDaily.Windows.MainWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="DeskDaily for Windows · 技术验证"
        Width="440" Height="360"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterScreen"
        Background="#1E1E2E"
        ResizeMode="CanMinimize">
    <Grid>
        <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="24">
            <TextBlock Text="DeskDaily"
                       FontSize="34" FontWeight="Bold"
                       Foreground="#A78BFA"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Center" />
            <TextBlock Text="for Windows · 技术验证壳"
                       FontSize="16"
                       Foreground="#CDD6F4"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                       Margin="0,4,0,18" />
            <Border Background="#313244" CornerRadius="10" Padding="18,14">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Foreground="#CDD6F4" FontSize="12" LineHeight="20">
                        WPF (.NET 8) 最小可运行壳 · 构建链路已验证<LineBreak />
                        下一里程碑：核心逻辑移植（RepeatRule / OccurrenceKit）<LineBreak />
                        与 data.json 数据互通（schemaVersion=2 契约）
                    </TextBlock>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>
            <TextBlock Text="CDUESTC-OpenAtom-Open-Source-Club"
                       FontSize="10"
                       Foreground="#6C7086"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                       Margin="0,16,0,0" />
        </StackPanel>
    </Grid>
</Window>
